# Izzet Signet: "{1}, {T}: Add {U}{R}." (CR 605.1a, a mana ability with mana in its own cost, CR 602.2b).
# Cast with two Islands on turn 3. On turn 5 two Islands tapped for {U}{U}, the ability's {1} paid from that pool, and the
# Signet adds {U}{R}: the pool is exactly {U}{U}{R}, so a free ability would leave {U}{U}{U}{R} and an ability adding one
# color would leave no {R}. Third Path Iconoclast costs {U}{R} and is cast from that pool, proving both mana are the colors
# printed. Green is refused beside the blue and red the ability does add (the plain activation is the positive control), and
# a tapped Signet is not offered a second time.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island x3
Izzet Signet
Third Path Iconoclast
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Izzet Signet.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {U}{U}
! Bot1.Battlefield.Izzet Signet.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Izzet Signet.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}{U}{R}
! Bot1.Battlefield.Izzet Signet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Third Path Iconoclast.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Izzet Signet.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Third Path Iconoclast.Subtypes = Human; Monk
Bot1.Life = 20
